== Usage ==
=== Types ===
*<code>p</code> or <code>pair</code> – ''(default)'' display a matched pair of open-and-close tags: {{tag|div|pair}}
*<code>o</code> or <code>open</code> – display only the opening tag of an open-and-close pair: {{tag|span|open}}
*<code>c</code> or <code>close</code> – display only the closing tag of an open-and-close pair: {{tag|span|close}}
*<code>s</code> or <code>single</code> – display a single tag: {{tag|br|single}}

=== Examples ===
* {{tlx|tag|ref}} → {{tag|ref}}
* {{tlx|tag|ref|content{{=}}hello}} → {{tag|ref|content=hello}}
* {{tlx|tag|span|content{{=}}foo}} → {{tag|span|content=foo}}
* {{tlx|tag|span|open}} → {{tag|span|open}}
* {{tlx|tag|span|open|content{{=}}hello}} → {{tag|span|open|content=hello}}
* {{tlx|tag|span|close|content{{=}}hello}} → {{tag|span|close|content=hello}}
* {{tlx|tag|span|pair|content{{=}}hello}} → {{tag|span|pair|content=hello}}
* {{tlx|tag|ref|open|params{{=}}{{tlx|attr|group|"note"}}}} → {{tag|ref|open|params={{attr|group|"note"}}}}
* {{tlx|tag|references|single}} → {{tag|references|single}}
* {{tlx|tag|br|single}} → {{tag|br|single}}

